flowchart LR
  R[Request] --> C{Cache hit?}
  C -- yes --> OUT[Response]
  C -- no --> P1[Primary provider]
  P1 -- ok --> OUT
  P1 -- 429/timeout --> P2[Secondary provider]
  P2 -- ok --> OUT
  P2 -- fail --> LOC[Local small model]
  LOC -- ok --> OUT
  LOC -- fail --> REP[Replay recorded response, labeled]
  REP --> OUT
